Package: h2gam
Title: Automated GAM Covariate Validation and Selection for 'mgcv'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hugo", "Parra", email = "h2ugo.parra@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Given a response and a pool of candidate covariates, profiles the
    response and auto-suggests an 'mgcv' family (count / proportion / positive /
    gaussian branches, ranked by AIC and residual diagnostics), forward-selects
    a decorrelated, prediction-relevant covariate subset scored by spatial-block
    or response-stratified cross-validation with a concurvity gate and a
    BIC tie-break / one-standard-error stopping rule, then runs a bidirectional
    backward re-check and a final shrinkage fit with adequacy diagnostics.
    Structural (spatial/temporal) terms are forced in and not screened, so
    covariates must earn their place over and above them.
